<title>AUSTRALIA: NAB APPOINTS KEY TREASURY DEALER.</title>
<headline>NAB APPOINTS KEY TREASURY DEALER.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Australian Bank Ltd said on Monday it has appointed John Martin-Alcaide to a senior sales position on its institutional and corporate sales desk within Australian treasury.</p>
<p>NAB said Martin-Alcaide has 11 years experience in the Melbourne market with National Mutual Royal Bank and Australia and New Zealand Banking Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
